/*
  SignalDiffTable.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0268 · SignalDiffTable (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `SignalDiffTable` resolves (table "SignalDiffTable") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first block is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/telemetry/components/SignalDiffTable.tsx + the shared SourceLayerBadge
  it composes). The rest backs the native-only chrome (error/retry, stale/offline
  banners, accessibility) the web delegates to its host page / shared components.
*/

